# armour/shared/pauldron_flared4_l: the large FLARED pauldron on the left shoulder (flared.4; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# lames stacked over the shoulder, the inner one rising into a standing guard beside the neck: the outline's notch
# (ARMOURER'S, steel). Each lame a lit top row over its shadow; the guard's face lit, its glint at the tip.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the guard's rim and the lowest lame's hem, G the guard's rivet, N the seams between lames, P the top lame.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
